{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"pass\": true, \"problems\": [], \"unexplained\": [], \"reason\": \"合格。最重要的S05-B1得到了实质解释：此前已经真实经历过“留不住同一刻”的不安，而刚刚又达到近乎过量的充足，因此此刻的骤然不同会被体验成刚才那一刻已经过去的失落，并带出游移和不确定；这不是泛泛的“经历过所以不同”。S05-B2、B3也分别由既有的亲近、充足和过量后的安静解释，没有增加离别、关系变化等外部事件。两条选中文字与M13、M18原话一致，依赖的H4–H8均是此前实际解释过听感的历史；额外的去处说明基本是在展开已有因果，没有另造心理步骤。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d3042988-8439-46ab-8f3f-6f2acc4be96b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261027T223940609831Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.922, "completed_utc": "2026-10-27T22:40:02.530901+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ebd675e5809a6ab8043f618f3812eb2cc44fb89bab95b4751114834d22adde3a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true,